                                    <h2>Audix DP Elite 8</h2>
                    
                    <h2 class="sub">                    8-Mic Set</h2>
                    <p>The DP Elite 8 is an 8-piece drum mic package with some of Audix&#8217;s top mics. It is nearly identical to the Studio Elite 8 kit, swapping the large-diaphragm overhead mics in the Studio kit for a pair of pencil mics in the DP kit.</p><p>This set includes:</p><ul><li>One D6 for kick drum</li><li>One i5 for snare drum</li><li>Two D2 for rack toms</li><li>One D4 for floor tom</li><li>Two SCX1 with Cardioid capsules for overheads</li><li>One SCX1 with Hypercardioid capsule for hi-hat</li></ul><p>The SCX-1 is a pencil mic with detachable capsules. This kit includes three, two with cardioid capsules and one with hypercardioid capsule. </p><p><img src="http://cdn.recordinghacks.com/images/mic_extras/audix/dvice.jpg" class="thumb shaft" alt="Audix DVice gooseneck rim clamp" width="133" /></a>Four DVICE mounts are included. The DVICE is an adjustable rim mount, with a gooseneck arm to facilitate mic positioning. The DVICE includes the DCLIP, a rigid plastic clip engineered to tightly grip the end of the D2/D4/D6 body.<p>Permalink: <a href="//recordinghacks.com/microphones/Audix/DP-Elite-8">Audix DP-Elite-8</a></p>                    
